  "sourceAssessment": [
    "assertIntegratedCurrent first authenticates all four real current inputs plus every retained archive/source, then obtains an exact predecessor read adapter for the unchanged bootstrap/full current assertions. A projected predecessor cannot pass the real current guard.",
    "pc06CiSource projects only three explicit registered CI seams after an exact current LF hash match. The product generator is authenticated without projection. Wrong before SHA, changed/foreign/null/object/Buffer and foreign path remain visible; pc06CiRead preserves binary object identity and does not convert a UTF-8 Buffer into authenticated text.",
    "No catch/default hides missing, read failure or drift. The independent warmed retained-source fault probe confirms the identical thrown Error object propagates through the complete current guard for both retained helper boundaries.",
    "Packet contains exactly four input records. All before sources, SHA256 and Git blobs were independently compared with actual Release1cc; all current sources, SHA256 and Git blobs were independently compared with exact HEAD. The two product files remain byte-equal to21d48c4e.",
    "The fixed-hash new leaf is the reviewed trust root, excluded from its own packet. Packet hash rejects truncation or record deletion at import. Packet metadata and its internal blob calculations alone are not treated as source provenance: independent Git comparison above supplies that link. A coherent rewrite of trust leaf/packet requires another review; this is not a signature or adversarial execution sandbox.",
    "The retained868f bootstrap packet/helper remain exact Git bytes. Its10 current views match actual Release1cc individually. The new immutable archive map equals exactly the old92 map plus868f itself; 91 raw Git gzip bytes and2 unchanged LFS pointers/payload oid+size all match.",
    "Raw JS/Lua discoveries independently equal the entire packet/bootstrap inventory, with876/1423 unique paths. No new raw parent, workflow, timing, partition, unknown10s or workload-budget change is present.",
    "Original three-case assertion source is byte-equal to actual1cc after removing only new tests/imports and the explicit prior-view plumbing. Current after freshness is separately guarded before that plumbing. Old historical views and packets were not rewritten.",
    "copyIntegrationSourceClosure and production helper list are unchanged. The independent targeted real-copy test passed, including352-path/116-owner proof equality, absence of new CI leaf/packet in production copy, warm second-copy success, helper drift rejection and missing archive rejection."
  ],
